{
  "_": [
    "jurassic_park_le on JPSalas & marty's 'Jurassic Park Pro Le' 4.02 (VPUniverse 20502, PAD-887),",
    "a SCRIPTED tribute (JPSalas's template: battles, jackpots; LoadEM, SolLFlipper/",
    "SolRFlipper, plungerIM) on Stern's own Jurassic Park playfield: fitted to the",
    "rig's drawing on seven anchors (outlanes, return lanes, the three pops) at an rms",
    "of 8 table units (x = 3.361 dx + 0.010 dy - 56.1, y = -0.002 dx + 3.355 dy - 179.0),",
    "and every Pro switch but the flipper EOS has an object within ~60 units of it.",
    "It replaces marty's 'Jurassic Park Limited Edition' 1.0, dropped by PAD-860 (its",
    "rules and switch layout were another game's).",
    "Two spinners stand where the machine has OPTOS (right orbit enter, right half pipe):",
    "`pass` pulses once a pass. The table's teleport kickers (K1/K2, K7/K8, Ktrex,",
    "Khouse, Kheli) and its self-kicking holes (lock, Kcroco, KsaveR, and PyramidKicker",
    "on the Pro) keep their own subs.",
    "LE: PyramidKicker is the raptor pit lock (RAPTOR LOCK OPTO, LOCK-RAPTOR PIT coil);",
    "K7 is the left ramp's mouth; Targetraptor the motor bank's target. The T-Rex",
    "and the bank's motor are the rig's to answer, as on any LE run."
  ],
  "title": "jurassic_park_le",
  "model": "LE",
  "preferred": false,
  "detect": [
    "Jurassic Park Le Script JPSalas & marty"
  ],
  "output": "Jurassic Park Pro Le (PAD).vpx",
